WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.890
<b>Kuze Maternity Hospital</b>

00:00.000 --> 00:02.890
<b>Kuze Maternity Hospital</b>

00:02.980 --> 00:06.650
<b>Episode 1: Can't Charm Him</b>

00:06.690 --> 00:09.110
<b>Newborn Nursery</b>

00:25.250 --> 00:27.000
<b>Mona Kawai</b>

00:27.000 --> 00:29.750
<b>Leader</b>

00:34.920 --> 00:38.350
Hey, Mona-chan, you've got some cream on ya.

00:42.650 --> 00:45.730
How're you so dang cute?

00:47.130 --> 00:51.350
One, two, three...

00:51.730 --> 00:55.490
Four, five, six...

00:52.670 --> 00:53.980
Gotta dash!

00:53.980 --> 00:55.490
She's comin' for us!

00:55.830 --> 00:58.740
Seven, eight...

00:56.930 --> 00:58.740
Whatcha standin' around for?

00:58.740 --> 01:01.240
Nine, ten!

01:03.480 --> 01:05.480
C-Catch me.

01:05.480 --> 01:06.450
Me too.

01:06.450 --> 01:07.250
Me three.

01:07.250 --> 01:10.090
No fair! Grab me too!

01:10.090 --> 01:11.210
And me!

01:11.210 --> 01:15.500
Hey, c'mon, this ain't how you play tag.

01:21.440 --> 01:24.630
<i>That's right. I'm the queen bee wherever I go.</i>

01:27.770 --> 01:31.020
<b>— Tokyo —</b>

01:58.470 --> 02:00.420
Morning, beautiful.

02:27.410 --> 02:27.830
<b>m 82 222 l 159 118 327 136 364 231 332 300 146 325</b>

02:27.410 --> 02:27.830
<b>Medaka!</b>

02:28.080 --> 02:28.830
<b>m 255 63 l 290 32 404 38 432 83 404 116 286 114</b>

02:28.080 --> 02:28.830
<b>Why are you
always so mean
to Mona-chan?</b>

02:28.080 --> 02:28.830
<b>m 92 258 l 114 236 171 228 225 239 246 266 236 300 214 317 140 318 88 292</b>

02:28.080 --> 02:28.830
<b>Do your tenets
not tell you to be
nice to people?</b>

03:24.260 --> 03:30.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

03:24.260 --> 03:30.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

03:54.170 --> 03:55.420
Mornin'!

03:55.420 --> 03:56.960
Morning, Mona-chan.

03:56.960 --> 03:58.050
Morning.

03:58.050 --> 03:59.000
Morning.

03:59.000 --> 04:00.420
Good morning.

04:00.420 --> 04:01.800
Morning, Mona-chan.

04:01.800 --> 04:02.930
Morning!

04:02.930 --> 04:04.220
Good morning to you too.

04:04.220 --> 04:05.300
M-Morning.

04:05.300 --> 04:06.850
Hey.

04:06.850 --> 04:09.220
Good morning, Mona-senpai.

04:12.430 --> 04:13.520
Morning, everyone.

04:13.520 --> 04:15.020
Morning!

04:15.020 --> 04:16.770
Morning!

04:19.280 --> 04:21.320
Good morning, Kuroiwa-kun.

04:27.240 --> 04:28.370
Yeah, morning.

04:28.030 --> 04:30.950
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

04:28.030 --> 04:30.950
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa</b>

04:31.250 --> 04:36.250
<i>Why's this fool, and this fool alone, givin' me 
the stink-eye morning after morning?</i>

04:36.710 --> 04:41.510
Your uniform's not here yet, huh? 
How are you settling into our class?

04:41.510 --> 04:45.010
Er, been about two weeks 
since you transferred in, right?

04:48.010 --> 04:50.760
Right, of course you're still nervous.

04:50.760 --> 04:53.730
Want me to show you around school again?

04:53.730 --> 04:57.730
If you ever need anything, just ask, okay?

04:57.730 --> 04:58.480
Okay?

04:58.770 --> 05:01.780
Medaka-kun's receiving the 
Blessing of Mona-chan yet again.

05:01.780 --> 05:04.450
Tch. Hate that guy.

05:04.450 --> 05:05.950
Listen.

05:05.950 --> 05:06.990
Yeah?

05:07.240 --> 05:10.700
Just... leave me alone, would you?

05:15.790 --> 05:18.790
<i>The heck? This makes no sense.</i>

05:18.790 --> 05:21.960
<i>How could there be a guy 
who refuses to give me the time of day?</i>

05:22.250 --> 05:26.930
<i>There's a ten-outta-ten sittin' right 
next to you! Get a clue, fella!</i>

05:27.260 --> 05:31.140
<i>My queen bee ego's startin' 
to take a beating, here.</i>

05:38.770 --> 05:39.980
<i>Cat pics?</i>

05:39.980 --> 05:42.900
<i>And he smashed the like button on that one!</i>

05:42.900 --> 05:45.900
<i>So that's what he's into.</i>

05:46.150 --> 05:49.110
You like cats, Kuroiwa-kun?

05:50.240 --> 05:51.830
I'd love...

05:52.200 --> 05:53.790
to take a look...

05:54.200 --> 05:56.620
at them with mew!

06:00.210 --> 06:01.590
Just kittying... Unless?

06:01.590 --> 06:02.710
<i>How ya like that?</i>

06:02.960 --> 06:05.260
Cute!

06:06.300 --> 06:09.050
<i>Hah, aren't I just?</i>

06:10.550 --> 06:12.640
<i>Hey, that got him to react.</i>

06:12.640 --> 06:15.020
<i>That musta made his heart skip a beat!</i>

06:16.930 --> 06:18.480
No pics fur mew.

06:22.440 --> 06:24.020
<i>Y-You gotta be kiddin' me!</i>

06:24.020 --> 06:25.900
He... He's trolling her?

06:25.900 --> 06:28.530
He's playing off the "mew" thing!

06:28.530 --> 06:32.870
D-Damn it, Kuroiwa! 
Don't embarrass her like that!

06:32.870 --> 06:34.740
She just blessed you!

06:34.740 --> 06:36.120
H-Hey, listen.

06:36.120 --> 06:37.250
What?

06:37.640 --> 06:41.210
Can you also stop talking to me 
unless it's absolutely necessary?

06:41.710 --> 06:43.630
<i>How can this be?!</i>

06:44.460 --> 06:46.000
Let's play, Mona-chan.

06:46.000 --> 06:47.420
It's my turn today!

06:47.420 --> 06:49.170
No, it ain't! It's mine!

06:49.550 --> 06:51.640
<i>All my life...</i>

06:52.220 --> 06:55.850
I think I like you, or something.

06:56.230 --> 06:58.520
<i>All my life...</i>

06:59.560 --> 07:02.310
Do you know what roses stand for?

07:02.310 --> 07:04.270
It's romance.

07:04.570 --> 07:06.730
<i>All. My. Life!</i>

07:07.940 --> 07:12.030
<i>I've been showered with 
attention and adoration!</i>

07:12.990 --> 07:16.330
<i>This sucks!</i>

07:13.370 --> 07:15.620
Even the way she runs is cute!

07:15.620 --> 07:16.870
Right?

07:17.790 --> 07:21.030
<i>Why hasn't he been charmed by me yet?</i>

07:22.000 --> 07:23.830
<i>Why, I oughta...</i>

07:24.960 --> 07:26.300
<b>Fes</b>

07:26.300 --> 07:30.470
<i>Check out my lethal legs! 
The boys can't get enough of 'em!</i>

07:30.920 --> 07:32.260
<i>Booyah!</i>

07:32.260 --> 07:35.300
<i>Makes you wanna stop and stare, huh?</i>

07:44.150 --> 07:45.610
<i>Fine...</i>

07:45.610 --> 07:46.730
<i>Panties it is!</i>

07:47.110 --> 07:49.440
M-M-M-Mona-chan, are you okay?

07:49.440 --> 07:50.940
M-M-Mo...

07:50.940 --> 07:53.820
Owie... I fell.

07:55.320 --> 07:57.990
D-Did you see?

08:03.710 --> 08:05.000
N-N-No.

08:05.000 --> 08:07.170
I saw nothing, I swear.

08:07.170 --> 08:09.800
<i>Even that didn't work?</i>

08:09.800 --> 08:12.840
<i>Even that didn't get him?</i>

08:12.840 --> 08:15.390
<i>Th-Then I'm left with no choice.</i>

08:15.640 --> 08:16.970
<i>Last resort!</i>

08:17.600 --> 08:23.230
What this means is, uh... 
you know what it means.

08:23.640 --> 08:25.060
Sensei.

08:25.520 --> 08:27.020
What's wrong, Kawai?

08:31.440 --> 08:35.530
May I go to the nurse's office? 
I don't feel too good.

08:35.530 --> 08:38.530
Of course. Somebody go with her.

08:38.530 --> 08:39.660
I'll go.

08:42.410 --> 08:46.000
Actually, Kuroiwa-kun will take me there.

08:46.460 --> 08:47.830
So it's okay.

08:47.830 --> 08:50.920
Yeah? Take care of her, Kuroiwa.

08:53.380 --> 08:55.720
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

08:59.350 --> 09:03.060
I-I thought you said you didn't feel too good.

09:04.560 --> 09:09.230
You know, Kuroiwa-kun, the school nurse 
is usually away this time of day.

09:12.320 --> 09:16.610
<i>You're the first guy to ever 
make me go this far.</i>

09:17.780 --> 09:21.910
Hey... How do you feel about me?

09:23.750 --> 09:25.960
You're always so cold.

09:25.960 --> 09:29.330
I'm worried I did something 
to make you hate me.

09:29.330 --> 09:32.420
N-Nah, it's not like that.

09:32.840 --> 09:33.920
<i>Score.</i>

09:36.590 --> 09:38.510
<i>Victory is mine!</i>

09:40.100 --> 09:40.970
<i>No!</i>

09:41.540 --> 09:43.970
<i>N-Not that look again!</i>

09:46.440 --> 09:47.890
<i>Too late to back out now!</i>

09:48.730 --> 09:50.440
Can we talk?

09:50.440 --> 09:52.270
See? We've got some perfect—

10:00.490 --> 10:03.120
<i>Oh, shoot! I crossed the line!</i>

10:03.120 --> 10:05.700
S-Sorry. I tripped.

10:09.580 --> 10:13.550
<i>H-He's got me on top of him 
and he's still mad?!</i>

10:15.710 --> 10:20.640
<i>No... There's no way my charms 
are this ineffective.</i>

10:21.850 --> 10:26.020
<i>I'm the queen bee, y'know!</i>

10:26.020 --> 10:28.520
Oops, my hands slipped!

10:28.520 --> 10:29.480
<i>How 'bout now?!</i>

10:30.770 --> 10:34.360
<i>N-No more! I really can't go any further!</i>

10:34.360 --> 10:38.360
<i>Please just fall for me already, Medaka!</i>

10:39.320 --> 10:42.780
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit!</i>

10:46.910 --> 10:49.540
Wh-Why?

10:47.080 --> 10:49.870
<b>teary...</b>

10:50.170 --> 10:52.250
No... No!

10:52.250 --> 10:55.840
So mean! Why do you keep glaring at me?!

11:08.270 --> 11:10.100
Are you okay, Mona-chan?

11:23.450 --> 11:27.740
U-Um, I'm fine. You can let go now.

11:27.990 --> 11:28.750
Ack!

11:29.450 --> 11:33.630
W-Wait, no! I wasn't trying to, um...

11:35.540 --> 11:38.460
I'm going back to class.

11:53.100 --> 12:00.360
Also, you should save that kind of thing 
for a guy you really like, probably.

12:03.160 --> 12:05.240
What the...

12:07.120 --> 12:09.950
<b>HNNNGH</b>

12:12.960 --> 12:16.960
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

12:12.960 --> 12:16.960
What am <i>I</i> getting charmed for?!

12:26.890 --> 12:28.680
Oh, Mona-chan.

12:29.180 --> 12:30.680
Feeling better?

12:30.970 --> 12:34.140
Yep, thanks for asking.

12:38.060 --> 12:43.320
Th-Thank you for taking me 
to the nurse's office earlier.

12:43.320 --> 12:44.320
Sure.

12:47.870 --> 12:50.740
<i>Why do I feel a gaze?</i>

12:55.460 --> 12:58.840
<i>Meanwhile, I can't look him in the eye.</i>

12:59.460 --> 13:01.130
<i>But why?</i>

13:02.210 --> 13:06.340
<i>Why do I feel so flustered?</i>

13:06.890 --> 13:09.850
<i>This almost makes it seem like...</i>

13:10.890 --> 13:14.060
<i>It's like I'm in love with him or something.</i>

13:15.350 --> 13:16.770
Damn it!

13:16.770 --> 13:18.100
Mona-chan?!

13:16.770 --> 13:18.100
Mona-chan?!

13:22.030 --> 13:24.610
<i>Just you wait, Medaka.</i>

13:28.490 --> 13:34.830
<i>I swear... I swear on my life 
I'll capture your heart!</i>

13:38.580 --> 13:40.960
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

13:43.550 --> 13:45.970
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

13:48.680 --> 13:52.140
<i>Day after day,</i>

13:52.560 --> 13:55.140
<i>I'm so pretty.</i>

13:53.770 --> 13:55.140
Morning, Mona-chan.

13:55.140 --> 13:56.390
Morning.

13:56.390 --> 13:59.150
<i>Day after day,</i>

13:59.560 --> 14:01.690
<i>I'm so pretty.</i>

13:59.560 --> 14:01.690
Different day, same cute Mona.

14:01.960 --> 14:03.360
Morning!

14:02.480 --> 14:06.650
<i>Very, very pretty Mona!</i>

14:04.730 --> 14:06.240
Good morning!

14:10.160 --> 14:11.410
Morning.

14:12.160 --> 14:15.580
Your uniform arrived at last, huh?

14:15.580 --> 14:16.410
Yeah.

14:18.620 --> 14:22.380
<i>Medaka's the only one 
who looks at me with disgust.</i>

14:22.380 --> 14:26.170
<i>Where does he get off givin' a girl 
as lovely as me the stink-eye?</i>

14:32.550 --> 14:34.680
Something wrong, Asahi?

14:35.180 --> 14:36.470
Nothing.

14:49.700 --> 14:50.660
Yes!

14:50.660 --> 14:52.660
That's how you do the splits.

14:52.660 --> 14:54.780
Make sure you get your stretches in!

14:55.620 --> 14:57.910
<i>Look at me, Medaka!</i>

14:57.910 --> 15:00.080
<i>Look how buxom and supple I am!</i>

15:00.960 --> 15:02.500
Kuroiwa-kun!

15:03.290 --> 15:06.050
Let's stretch together.

15:06.050 --> 15:08.210
Hey. You're being summoned.

15:08.510 --> 15:11.430
<i>Is that fool hard of hearin'?</i>

15:11.430 --> 15:13.470
Girls, get ready to play.

15:13.890 --> 15:17.180
<i>Just what can I hook him with?</i>

15:17.970 --> 15:19.890
<i>My legs, my ass,</i>

15:19.890 --> 15:21.900
<i>even my boobs... None of 'em worked.</i>

15:24.940 --> 15:26.730
<i>Th-That's it!</i>

15:27.030 --> 15:34.370
Also, you should save that kind of thing 
for a guy you really like, probably.

15:36.030 --> 15:38.750
<i>Yeah, no, I don't care.</i>

15:37.370 --> 15:40.370
I'm announcing the teams.

15:39.660 --> 15:41.370
<i>And it doesn't matter.</i>

15:41.370 --> 15:43.920
<i>I'll make you fall for me, and that'll be that.</i>

15:48.920 --> 15:50.510
Okay, all done.

15:52.680 --> 15:55.760
Phew, I'm beat.

15:57.260 --> 15:59.220
<i>My sweat glistens,</i>

16:01.350 --> 16:03.060
<i>as my nimble hands wipe it off.</i>

16:06.560 --> 16:08.020
<i>And the clincher...</i>

16:12.780 --> 16:17.450
M-Mona-chan's normally 
hidden sanctuary is laid bare!

16:17.450 --> 16:20.410
Thank you, gods!

16:20.410 --> 16:24.500
<i>Neither T nor A worked, but he's 
gotta have a thing for bellies!</i>

16:24.500 --> 16:26.460
<i>How d'you like me now, Medaka?</i>

16:31.380 --> 16:35.050
Clear mind, clear spirit.

16:37.180 --> 16:39.350
<i>But why?!</i>

16:48.310 --> 16:53.320
<i>Listen, I didn't follow you here 
or anything, Medaka.</i>

16:53.320 --> 16:59.950
<i>I just wanted to get a good look at the guy 
who can resist my charms so.</i>

17:05.620 --> 17:10.380
<i>Yep, knew it. He won't even look up at me.</i>

17:12.010 --> 17:13.720
<i>Screw it.</i>

17:14.630 --> 17:16.430
<i>I'm done for the day.</i>

17:30.860 --> 17:32.820
<i>Mm? Hello?</i>

17:34.440 --> 17:37.490
<i>Was he unable to take his eyes off me just now?</i>

17:40.950 --> 17:43.230
<i>I made a fist by accident...</i>

17:50.090 --> 17:50.670
Huh?

17:52.130 --> 17:53.800
Eek!

17:54.090 --> 17:56.090
Nope! Nope, nope!

17:56.510 --> 17:57.550
<i>I...</i>

17:57.550 --> 18:01.220
<i>This ain't good! I'm givin' too much away!</i>

18:01.220 --> 18:03.850
<i>This totally sucks!</i>

18:03.850 --> 18:07.440
<i>Why do I gotta embarrass myself 
like this for Medaka?!</i>

18:17.990 --> 18:19.910
Put this on.

18:28.750 --> 18:31.840
I'm... gonna head back in.

18:34.710 --> 18:37.550
Th... Thanks.

18:39.990 --> 18:40.980
No problem.

18:43.350 --> 18:47.480
<i>Now </i>that<i> was a belly peek!</i>

18:51.100 --> 18:54.270
Kuroiwa-kun gave her his gym shirt?

19:04.330 --> 19:07.750
Wait, that shirt must stink.

19:09.870 --> 19:10.830
Heya!

19:10.830 --> 19:12.630
Medaka Kuroiwa.

19:12.630 --> 19:13.540
What?

19:13.540 --> 19:18.460
Kuroiwa-kun, don't you think you're 
being a little too mean to Mona-chan?

19:21.470 --> 19:26.720
She's trying so hard to be friendly, 
you know? It isn't right, dude.

19:26.720 --> 19:28.140
Come with us for a sec.

19:41.780 --> 19:43.740
Heir to a temple?!

19:41.780 --> 19:43.740
Heir to a temple?!

19:43.740 --> 19:46.330
Yeah, a cat temple.

19:46.330 --> 19:49.200
I'm forbidden from getting too close to girls.

19:49.580 --> 19:52.460
So you've never had a girlfriend?

19:53.880 --> 19:57.800
We only had senior citizens 
and goats back home.

20:00.300 --> 20:04.300
I don't even know what to talk to girls about.

20:06.600 --> 20:07.810
Now it makes sense.

20:07.810 --> 20:10.560
No wonder you ended up treating her like crap.

20:12.270 --> 20:16.560
<i>I'd only ever seen girls as cute 
and pretty as her on TV.</i>

20:16.560 --> 20:18.520
<i>But it didn't stop there.</i>

20:26.410 --> 20:28.120
<i>Tokyo...</i>

20:29.290 --> 20:31.750
<i>Tokyo's so full of temptation!</i>

20:31.750 --> 20:36.750
But, hey, surely you won't get punished 
for trying to be a little nicer.

20:37.460 --> 20:39.940
Yeah, maybe.

20:39.940 --> 20:42.420
<i>Honestly, the way things are going,</i>

20:42.420 --> 20:44.180
<i>I'm gonna fall for her!</i>

20:44.180 --> 20:47.300
<i>But I can't! My life is dedicated to religion!</i>

20:47.300 --> 20:50.060
<i>And the tenets forbid romance!</i>

20:51.680 --> 20:52.520
He froze.

20:52.980 --> 20:57.650
<i>But just imagine going out 
with a girl like her...</i>

20:57.650 --> 20:58.820
<i>Mwahaha.</i>

20:58.820 --> 21:00.150
Yikes, creepy.

21:01.360 --> 21:03.070
Impure thoughts, begone!

21:04.200 --> 21:14.410
Clear mind, clear spirit.

21:08.910 --> 21:12.450
He's trying to clear his mind 
when he makes that face?

21:13.080 --> 21:15.620
He was doing his best to resist, huh?

21:15.900 --> 21:18.790
<i>Remember, I'm in training.</i>

21:18.790 --> 21:22.760
<i>I only transferred to a co-ed school 
to hone my mind!</i>

21:23.360 --> 21:27.390
<i>I must live my life free of 
temptation and worldly desire!</i>

21:32.140 --> 21:33.220
Morning!

21:33.980 --> 21:35.890
Thanks for yesterday.

21:35.890 --> 21:37.310
S-Sure.

21:37.980 --> 21:39.810
Don't worry, I washed it.

21:39.810 --> 21:42.190
Y-You didn't have to.

21:45.740 --> 21:48.870
What, you wanted it back with my scent on it?

21:50.240 --> 21:54.830
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit!</i>

21:55.460 --> 21:59.170
<i>Mona Kawai, seventeen. Osaka born and bred.</i>

21:59.170 --> 22:01.000
<i>Moved to Tokyo one year ago.</i>

22:01.000 --> 22:04.960
<i>Never in my life have I encountered 
a boy who could resist my charms.</i>

22:05.380 --> 22:09.970
<i>Medaka Kuroiwa... 
I swear I'll make you fall for me!</i>

23:44.940 --> 23:49.940
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

23:44.940 --> 23:49.940
<b>Episode 2





In Love with Him</b>

23:46.820 --> 23:49.590
Next time: "In Love with Him."
